    'consul.node_health_check_status': {
        info: '<a href="https://developer.hashicorp.com/consul/tutorials/developer-discovery/service-registration-health-checks#monitor-a-node" target="_blank">节点健康检查</a>的当前状态。节点健康检查监视整个节点的健康状况。如果节点健康检查失败，Consul 会将该节点标记为不健康。'
