    'consul.service_health_check_status': {
        info: '<a href="https://developer.hashicorp.com/consul/tutorials/developer-discovery/service-registration-health-checks#monitor-a-service" target="_blank">服务健康检查</a>的当前状态。服务检查仅影响与其关联的服务的健康状况。如果服务健康检查失败，DNS 接口将停止返回该服务。'
